flowchart TD
    Start([Agent Execution Request]) --> Auth{Authentication<br/>Valid?}
    
    Auth -->|No| Reject[Return 401<br/>Unauthorized]
    Auth -->|Yes| RateLimit{Rate Limit<br/>Check}
    
    RateLimit -->|Exceeded| RateLimitReject[Return 429<br/>Rate Limit Exceeded]
    RateLimit -->|OK| ValidateInput[Validate Input<br/>Schema Check]
    
    ValidateInput --> InputValid{Input<br/>Valid?}
    InputValid -->|No| InvalidInput[Return 422<br/>Validation Error]
    InputValid -->|Yes| QueueCheck{Execution<br/>Queue}
    
    QueueCheck -->|Queue Full| QueueFull[Return 503<br/>Queue Full]
    QueueCheck -->|Available| Enqueue[Add to Queue<br/>Return 202 Accepted]
    
    Enqueue --> ExecutionID[Generate Execution ID<br/>Update Status: Pending]
    ExecutionID --> Worker[Worker Picks Up<br/>From Queue]
    
    Worker --> UpdateRunning[Update Status:<br/>Running]
    UpdateRunning --> LoadAgent[Load Agent<br/>Configuration]
    
    LoadAgent --> PrepareContext[Prepare Execution<br/>Context & Memory]
    PrepareContext --> CallModel[Call AI Model<br/>With Prompt & Input]
    
    CallModel --> ModelResponse{Model<br/>Response}
    ModelResponse -->|Timeout| Timeout[Update Status:<br/>Timeout]
    ModelResponse -->|Error| ModelError[Update Status:<br/>Failed]
    ModelResponse -->|Success| ProcessOutput[Process Output<br/>Transform Data]
    
    ProcessOutput --> RunHooks{Post-Execution<br/>Hooks?}
    RunHooks -->|Yes| ExecuteHooks[Execute Webhooks<br/>Notifications]
    RunHooks -->|No| SaveResult
    ExecuteHooks --> SaveResult[Save Result<br/>to Database]
    
    SaveResult --> UpdateMetrics[Update Metrics<br/>- Token Usage<br/>- Duration<br/>- Cost]
    
    UpdateMetrics --> Success[Update Status:<br/>Completed]
    
    Timeout --> NotifyTimeout[Notify User<br/>Timeout Occurred]
    ModelError --> NotifyError[Notify User<br/>Error Details]
    Success --> NotifySuccess[Notify User<br/>Result Available]
    
    NotifyTimeout --> End([Execution Complete])
    NotifyError --> End
    NotifySuccess --> End
    
    Reject --> End
    RateLimitReject --> End
    InvalidInput --> End
    QueueFull --> End
    
    style Start fill:#6366f1,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#fff
    style Success fill:#90ee90,stroke:#2f9e44
    style Timeout fill:#ffd93d,stroke:#f59f00
    style ModelError fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style Reject fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style End fill:#6b7280,stroke:#4b5563,color:#fff
